    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya gwasin ghweelmeeda Basaaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasissa Yosiya NG'UTAMIIDA ghweelmeeda Basaaka aba Yerusalemu; hean gwanuus gisilleanda Basaaka eaweedeaba damanang'wan bea sheeda madeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw ashoohoodiga gadiyoojiga jea gwasin aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha fuga Lawi was giinealshoodiga fuga sean bea Israeli was fuga ghaydidi aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, “Ayiina sandakwajeanda ghaydit jeeda gheeda ghayi deas Sulemaneeda was orjeeda Dawdi, was sugoocheanda fuga Israeli; maygudu ayeateena gheatkeagwa. Asi ghamneawa agadiyeesiina NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETEANG'WA sea fugaaschi was Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niba siisi ang'waay headaanyi aba jeeda gheeda ghweanigeagwa nea goobadiini dooshingeagwa, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda Dawdeeda was sugoocheanda Israeli sea orjeedaanyi was Sulemani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiinaada aba heeda ghaydit gawuurji gida dardeayda gealga ghweaniga buweadeegeagwa mawasa fuga Lawi, nea gaba nih miineadaysa gheeda ghwaan bea fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goonuuschi gisilleanda Basaaka, ak ghoakghaydiichi geat ak goosisi eara buweadeegeagwa, ak goosinyi gaweeda gidarukusiinda ASEETA Musa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw Yosiya buuneeda gichea ghoadayda ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea Basaaka aba jeeda haleanjeeda mideawa, was dayeega gisilga ea dayeega nooga was sagalamnyooji diktam ea damanamughuush, ea heew sagalamnyooji samwagu; suh seaniin gwaleabu heeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara fugaaschi hees ghoadayda nea meediing'siina, hean ghoadaw ashoohoodiga, ea fuga Lawi. Ak Hilkiya, ea Sakariya, ea Yehieli was fuga hees bea gheeda ASEETA, ghoadaw ashoohoodiga dayi sagalamnyooji iyeenya ea bughalaji lah bea gisilga ea nooga ea heew bughalaji samwagu ghoah haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea Basaaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eara Gonaniya, ea Shemaya, ea Netaneli was orjooga geanyaawa, ea Hashabiya, ea Yosabadi, was fuga madeeda fuga Lawi, ghoadaw fuga Lawi dayi sagalamnyooji muut bea gisilga ea nooga ea heew bughalaji muut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea nihit haleanjeeda sean bea Basaaka, hean ghamiinaada ashoohoodiga aba hoorgeeda nyaawa, ea fuga Lawi aba gadiyoojiga nyaawa gawuurji gidanyaashta diigheanda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwanuus dayeenda gisilleanda bea Basaaka ak ghwasakta ashoohoodiga foojeanda gan aba heeda gisilga nea fuga Lawi saawa gwajeeng'shi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geasachi haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida eadaah gichea eelakiisiinda gwadeatooschi aba gitardaayda gealga ghweaniga nyaawa, bea fuga gealaan ak geataw NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gissing'oarda aba jeeda gitaabooda Musa. Ak hean gwahindunu eara heewga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geabeash dayeenda Basaaka gawuurji gidanyaashta diigheanda; aba ng'ata geawu haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi aba jeeda dahuundiga, ea jeeda safurajeega, ea jeeda bakurajeega, ak gealamwachi eeyeasa buuneeda ghwaak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasissa geat saawa ak gwasissa eara ashoohoodiga, aba gideaba ashoohoodiga was orjooga Haruni gwanda jeeda gadiyeeda giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida ea nagheeda ea ghoah eawa; hean gwasin fuga Lawi geanyaawa ea gea ashoohoodiga was orjooga Haruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea hirgheata sarmani was orjooga Asafu, gwanda heeda nyaawa gawuurji gidanyaashta diigheanda Dawdi, ak Asafu, ea Hemani, ea Yedutuni was meanga sugoocheanda, ea furiischoodiga gidaghuudajeega gaba nih mida dooshta; nea magasa ghang'amwa heeda gadiyoojiga nyaawa, aba gideaba saawa gwasissa buweadeega nyaawa was fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gadiyoojiga sean bea NG'UTAMIIDA geahiit eaweedida, ging'ooyda Basaaka ea giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida aba badayda heeda wagiida bea NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gidanyaashta diigheanda Yosiya was sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak fuga Israeli mida hooweaniin ghwaang'waayi ghweelmeeda Basaaka aba damandida, ea ghweelmeeda mukaatajeega meematawana eawooji ispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Manda ghweelmeeda basaakeeda uurji diita goola eesin aba Israeli gidang'eada damanda Samweli was sibaneeda; nea aba jeeda sugoodiga Israeli manda dea nisinda Basaaka gidasinda Yosiya, ea ashoohoodiga, ea fuga Lawi, ea fuga sean bea Yuda ea Israeli mida hiji, sea fuga abiita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaakeeni geesin gweaydeaba damasis bea gheambalmeeda Yosiya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda gheambalmeeda Yosiya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ning'ata ng'asheesu seaniin, nea Yosiya ea niihiit deesta gheeda sibata ASEETA, gwadiyeada gang'uchi sugoocheanda Misri siguura Neko aba Garkemishi mida murdeeda Furati ak hean ghang'eat Yosiya gawa gang'uchi niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta niny giijasoodiga heeda Yosiya, ak gwayeesha, “Gigasayi eesimana naaha geat, ea sugoocheanda Yuda? Aniini mwawuni dang'ucheeweeyi, askwearjeanji, aniini ghaawunyi dang'uchi gheeda miisa ng'ucheeda; ak ea nigoonan diigheanda ASEETA gideaba gaydalamwajaada. Adiidu gisheang'nyeewi ASEETA, mida meatkweedeanyu, adiidu ghabwarnyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Yosiya ea mamwasa ghwanung'wa heeda, hean ghwayam geaw ghwanyas gichea gang'ucheata sea niny. Hean ea mooleeysiin iita ng'asheega Neko leabu ghuuta ASEETA, ng'ata gawa gang'uchi aba mooheeda Megido. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geefut aba ghuweang'da sugoocheanda was Yosiya; ng'ata gwayeesha fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda, “Oang'aamwanaani hiji, aba gideaba neasawani muuchi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageandeawa fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda jeeda mutukwajeandaanyi aba ng'ata geetiing'sa jeeda mutukwajeandeaba iyeenya ak geayaat Yerusalemu. Ng'ata ghami, aba ng'ata geebung'sa jeeda bung'eadinga ghweanigaaschi. Gagiisan Yudayda sean ea Yerusalemu aba badayda Yosiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak eara Yeremiya gagutu heareega Yosiya; hean eara headiga sean sarmani ea gadeemga gabaloola ng'asheega Yosiya aba jeeda shooka nyaawa ea ghoah ghamneawa. Hean geanung' ghoah deaweeda aba Israeli; ak ging'ulayi, sing'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda heareega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean muudeanooda gadiyoojiga Yosiya, ea doobiiwnataanyi gawuurji gissing'oarda aba jeeda diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hean eara sinaweagaaschi, gidang'eada gea madeeda ea gagul gea huuydean, ng'ula, geeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sugoodiga Israeli ea Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
